# qwen3.6:27b as the JUDGE, sized for a 16 GB card (RTX 5070 Ti) + 32 GB RAM.
#
# ~17 GB of weights do NOT fit in 16 GB VRAM. Expect 2-5 GB to spill to system
# RAM. That is fine on 32 GB and is why this model is usable on the Ti but was
# not on an 8 GB laptop (there, 17 GB against 15.7 GB of RAM meant it paged to
# DISK at ~1 token/s).
#
# Check after the first load:
#   ollama ps   -> expect roughly 75%/25% GPU/CPU, NOT a 0 GB working set
#
# num_ctx 16384 costs ~2.7 GB of KV cache. Dropping to 8192 buys back ~1.3 GB
# if the split looks worse than expected; judge prompts fit in 8K comfortably.
#
# Thinking is turned OFF for this model (think=False via THINK_BY_MODEL).
# Measured with thinking on: >10 min per judge call vs ~160 s with it off.
#
#   ollama create qwen36-judge -f Modelfile.qwen36-judge

FROM qwen3.6:27b

PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
